#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:307
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &klickety;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each page of the &klickety; configuration dialog has buttons labeled "
"<guibutton>Help</guibutton> and <guibutton>Defaults</guibutton>.The "
"<guibutton>Help</guibutton> button brings up this handbook, and the "
"<guibutton>Defaults</guibutton> button restores all the settings to their "
"default values."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:315
#, no-c-format
msgid "The individual options are as follows:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:318
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Appearance</guilabel> tab"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:322
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable Animations"
msgstr "Activar las animacions"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:323
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked, pieces are shown with an animation (a small rebound effect), "
"when they touch the bottom."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Fons"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Allows you to change the background color and change its opacity. Trivia: if "
"it has some transparency it doesn't actually show what's directly beneath "
"&klickety;, but rather it shows the desktop wallpaper."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Colors</guimenu> tab"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Colors #1 through #5 Allow you to change the colors of the colored blocks. "
"For an extra challenge, make them all the same color. N.B. You must restart "
"&klickety; for these changes to take effect."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:354
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tips"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:357
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Try to remove sets of two blocks to allow single blocks to join up with "
"other ones of the same color, it's your only way to get rid of them."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Spend time thinking about your move: you primarily get higher places on the "
"high score table by getting rid of more pieces than doing it quickly."
msgstr ""

